msgid "$O(n)$"
msgstr ""

msgid "`push` and `pop` do the same amount of work regardless of how many nodes are in the stack, since they only change the first node. The destructor, however, is $O(n)$: although `delete head;` is one statement, it triggers a destructor call for every node in the list."
msgstr "无论栈中有多少个节点，`push` 和 `pop` 所做的工作量都相同，因为它们只改变第一个节点。然而，析构函数是 $O(n)$ 的：虽然 `delete head;` 只是一条语句，它却会对链表中的每个节点调用一次析构函数。"

